{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈、悲\n、喜、捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "布施，愛語，利行，同事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陰即五陰之陰，由守意而攝心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺賢與羅什同時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即杜順"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二年或七年八年"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿難"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印度"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或即高僧傳裏所說的向居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "年十四歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "這是真的恐怖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楞伽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲門法眼由德山下開出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "老虎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道即僧，古時稱僧人為道人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即黃龍\n南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "德山雖呵佛罵祖，但他很守法持戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯其驚絕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯其微露"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯其深奧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯其回互"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯其隱微"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古名僧堂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓋澈是個癩痢頭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天啟崇禎也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即一切智、道種智、一切種智，此三種智於一心中同時具\n得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即\n名山家"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿彌陀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下皆約彌陀淨土言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日本以\n曇鸞、道綽、善導、懷感、少康為支那五祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即西安"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印光法師曾與爭辯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "建杭州彌陀佛寺，刻彌陀經於石。光緒十年，由汶溪西方寺淨\n果禮請為師終老。余於光緒三十三年始於西方寺閱藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依悟開法師所\n訂者應為十二祖，以印師在九祖後加行策為十祖，命終後其學人依次遞推，遂居十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或僅十念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以整個佛果言，理為境之一分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或加富樓那"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或經律藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見付法藏因緣傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按上皆說一切最\n後身菩薩者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按此句在佛法大小乘中為最特別義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句義亦特別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其不同處，與下說一切有部對勘可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句特義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上座部代表"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見五分律卷三十，十誦律卷六十，善見律毗婆沙卷一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑即大天等師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按戒本\n\n梵名波羅提木叉，廣律梵名毗尼即毗奈耶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應\n即十誦律之別譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即曇無德羅漢，或譯法正尊者是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即法礪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名化行二教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "施一切眾生皆共成佛道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "據賢首傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或僧肇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譯言淨教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "須\n知一念纔興早落顯境名言即屬阿含即屬文字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如曰實相曰異生性，則相為性而性為相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即一切種、種種明光遍照義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無垢友"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "總括淨土宗，融通念佛宗、真\n宗、時宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "包括日蓮宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊六卷五期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附俱舍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在世界佛\n教的三大系中，南方巴利文系只局在小乘三藏，未聞摩訶衍義。流行在衛藏的西藏文\n系，認為佛教所宗不是有部、經部，便是中觀、唯識，充分的說明了它只是本理的宗\n論的與授受的。能夠直本於佛，探一切經，在「博教約行」中，表現其偉大的創造力\n的，只有流傳在中國的漢文系的佛學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最近印順法師分為性空唯名論，虛妄唯識論，真常唯心論三種，雖內容不出我所分判的，不過\n「真常」、「虛妄」的用辭界限，殊不能明確的分清楚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法界圓覺宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法性空慧宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法相唯識宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "單品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法華涅槃及龍樹系"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴楞伽及世親學系"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊二十六卷九期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊二十五卷八期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見佛教日報\n第一期二期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上帝等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佃者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貴族"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在佛史亦稱獅子國"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十三卷四期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十卷一期"}
{"id": null, "n": "0679001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0679001", "type": "orig", "text": "本章原題「賢首學與天臺學比較研究」，係二十一年秋在世苑圖書館講，法舫筆記，載於海刊十三卷十一期。此處應講從禪出教之臺賢學，以曾講此文，乃略而不講。承大師意，編入以完成書。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0715002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0715002", "type": "orig", "text": "本章曾改題「中國淨土宗之演變」，載文史雜誌第四卷第九期。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0760003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0760003", "type": "orig", "text": "本論連續登載海刊二十五卷二十六卷。"}
